OL,5,G0530 Clodagh: Cooking at Home
OL,6,     FClodagh McKenna demonstrates four
OL,7,     Fof her favourite recipes for quick
OL,8,     Fand fabulous suppers, including a
OL,9,     Fchicken curry, and creamy Gruyere
OL,10,     Fbaked eggs. She then takes an
OL,11,     Femotional trip down memory lane to
OL,12,     Fshare a speedy pancetta and garlic
OL,13,     Fmussels dish inspired by her dad,
OL,14,     Fbefore whipping up a pan of cheesy
OL,15,     Flemony ate-night Alfredo pasta
